msgid "STM32F4 外部存储器"
msgstr "STM32F4 external memory"

msgid "本页分别说明 F407 FSMC 和 F479 FMC／QuadSPI，三种控制器不因名称相近共享硬件 权限。F407 FSMC 实现限定 STM32F407VET6（LQFP100）与 STM32F407ZGT6（LQFP144）； F479 软件参考的 CPU-only SDRAM 与间接串行 NOR 见本页后续章节。 一个 `nx_stm32_fsmc_t` 管理唯一 FSMC gate、共享 AF12 pads 和所选 bank receipt。 SRAM、LCD、PSRAM、NOR、NAND 端点借用这个 owner；端点不会另建 RCC、GPIO 或 控制器注册表。原有 NE3 启动 SRAM 仍由复位计划的同一 const bank 描述符证明， 永久 boot owner 不允许 stop，也不向运行时发放覆盖 globals 的整 bank lease。"
msgstr "This page separately describes F407 FSMC and F479 FMC/QuadSPI; similar names do not share hardware authority. F407 FSMC targets STM32F407VET6(LQFP100) and STM32F407ZGT6(LQFP144). The F479 software references for CPU-only SDRAM and indirect serial NOR are described below. One `nx_stm32_fsmc_t` owns the sole FSMC gate, shared AF12 pads and selected bank receipts. SRAM, LCD, PSRAM, NOR and NAND endpoints borrow that owner; endpoints create no separate RCC, GPIO or controller registry. The existing NE3 startup SRAM is still proved by the same const bank descriptor in the reset plan. Its permanent boot owner cannot stop or grant a runtime whole-bank lease overlapping globals."

msgid "硬件依据是 RM0090 Rev22 第 36 章及 DS8626 Rev12 的 AF12 映射和 FSMC 时序限制。 官方 `stm32f4xx_ll_fsmc.c` 负责 NORSRAM/NAND 初始化、读写时序和 ECC enable/disable。 F407 没有 FMC 的连续 clock、write FIFO disable 等新增控制位。同步外部 CLK 不得超过 60 MHz；CRAM 页边界用 CPSIZE 明确选择 128/256/512/1024 字节或关闭。"
msgstr "Hardware references are RM0090 Rev22 chapter36 and the AF12 mapping/FSMC timing limits in DS8626 Rev12. Official `stm32f4xx_ll_fsmc.c` implements NORSRAM/NAND initialization, read/write timings and ECC enable/disable. F407 lacks later FMC controls such as continuous clock and write-FIFO disable. External synchronous CLK must not exceed 60 MHz. CPSIZE explicitly selects a CRAM page boundary of 128/256/512/1024 bytes or disables it."

